{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act16side_level_act16side_03_end",
  "groupId": "act16side",
  "stageId": "act16side_03",
  "title": "混血兒",
  "storyCode": "GA-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "dd0d23c7894ca61cfaf285a1e26960420b8f095b6e4e7a8f79294475dba58e25",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "呼......呼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "他們想跑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "沒這麼簡單！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愉快的小販",
      "text": "......！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安靜的小販",
      "text": "唔呃......我掩護你，快逃！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "這個佩洛竟然幫薩卡茲擋下攻擊......兩個，都別想跑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "艾澤爾，你待在這兒，不許......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "不許輕舉妄動。我明白，菲亞梅塔小姐。終端我打開了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "請相信我，我想確保的只有塞茜莉亞的安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......我改主意了。你不能留在這裡。現在，立刻送塞茜莉亞前往大教堂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你們就這麼留在大街上......更危險。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "走吧，塞茜莉亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "嗯......？我們剛才不是向著聖像走的嗎，聖像在那邊，艾澤爾哥哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......我們繞一下路。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "繞路？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "你現在要去的地方應該是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "安魂教堂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "你們跑不掉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愉快的小販",
      "text": "她追得好快......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安靜的小販",
      "text": "怎麼辦怎麼辦，根本甩不掉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愉快的小販",
      "text": "事情因我而起......這個黎博利不可能放過我們的，你們走！我來殿後！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安靜的小販",
      "text": "你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愉快的小販",
      "text": "走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "退後。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "安，多，恩......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "別想再逃走......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲亞梅塔",
      "text": "給我滾出來！！！！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "我真不明白，教宗閣下為什麼對那幫“迷途者”如此......放任自流。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "莫斯提馬，你能告訴我嗎，既然你們認識？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我可不想和你談這個話題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "就這麼記仇？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "畢竟那時候我沒死在那傢伙手上，卻差點被你殺了呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "很難忘的經歷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "這就是你在我面前一直戴著帽子的原因？不難受嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "都做了這麼久萬國信使了。戴帽子而已。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "和你，多一事不如少一事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "你在埋怨我嗎，莫斯提馬？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "拉特蘭始終有拉特蘭要維護的東西，也總有人要在乎這些事。我無所謂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "莫斯提馬，你可能稍微有些誤解。很少有墮天使留在教廷，並不是因為教廷如何，而是因為那些墮天的薩科塔本身。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "我的態度也許是有一點特別......莫斯提馬，你以為自己就不是個怪胎嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "你這麼和我說話，就不怕我變成你口中那種“正常的墮天使”？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "如果你會，就聽不到我和你“這麼說話”了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "行吧。說點實在的，什麼時候把菲亞梅塔調走？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "總是跟著我，對她沒好處。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "這句話你不和她本人說嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "說過了，沒用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "我說就有用嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "根據我的觀察，權力的方便之處就是可以無視他人的意願。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "無視他人的意願是要付出代價的......你為什麼想調走菲亞梅塔，說來聽聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "菲亞梅塔說是我的護衛，你們就不好奇我有什麼需要她護衛的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "當然，也有人覺得她是我這個墮天使的監視者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "這麼想的人恐怕對菲亞梅塔沒有絲毫瞭解。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我不過是菲亞梅塔的餌，用來釣安多恩的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "她要是聽見你這麼說，恐怕不會很開心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "好吧，那我換個說法......餌是我背上這對鎖與匙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "所以？讓菲亞梅塔遂願有什麼不好嗎？如果她能幹掉安多恩，或者把他緝拿回大教堂，我當然樂見其成。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "還是說，你們倆加一塊也捉不到安多恩？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "那倒不至於。只要安多恩還惦記著鎖與匙，他就逃不掉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "只不過......我在想啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "如果安多恩已經找到別的路了呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "我不想見到的是，我走出來了，蕾繆安走出來了，甚至安多恩都走出來了......菲亞梅塔卻還陷在八年前那個雨夜裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "沒法和菲亞梅塔說這些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "也就是這種時候，我會稍微懷念一下共感的好處......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "啊，忘了菲亞梅塔是黎博利。那當我沒說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "真是年輕的話題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "怎麼，您要給我一點“過來人的教誨”嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "如果你允許我享受一下這種屬於長輩的小小特權。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "您請。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "還記得八年前你對我說的話嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......雖然我很不想破壞這麼溫情脈脈的氣氛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "抱歉，閣下，真忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "你說的是，“不......我還有要做的事，要保護的人”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫斯提馬",
      "text": "......聽薇爾麗芙學我說話也太惡寒了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薇爾麗芙",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "彼時彼刻，你不願讓我替你做選擇，此時此刻，你又何必要替菲亞梅塔做選擇呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "人的路總要自己去找，自己去選，自己去走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗",
      "text": "薇爾，這也是給你的回答。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......快到了，塞茜莉亞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "對不起，艾澤爾哥哥，我走得太慢了......太陽都快要落山了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "塞茜莉亞很了不起！畢竟沒辦法用公共交通......我們都走到移動地塊以外啦。要是我有菲亞梅塔小姐的身手和力氣，你也不用這麼辛苦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "沒關係的！其實媽媽也帶我出來過，我們會走到離家很遠的地方......和這裡也差不多。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "不過，菲亞梅塔姐姐不會發現我們偷偷來這裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "如果她只是查看終端的定位信號......希望我的花招至少能爭取一點時間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "好在還是抵達了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "媽媽就是來了這裡嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......塞茜莉亞，我想了很久應該怎麼和你解釋這件事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "費莉亞......你的媽媽，確實來了這裡，但她也不在這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "我沒辦法讓你再見到媽媽。但在這裡，你至少可以和她告別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥......你說的......我不太明白......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "如果媽媽來了這裡，又不在這裡，那她是......又去了別的地方嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "去了哪裡呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......我們先進去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭市民",
      "text": "......父親去世之前，一直希望他的葬禮上只有歡笑，不要有淚水，可我卻......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的修士",
      "text": "我想，令尊真正希望的是，您不因他的離去陷入無法自拔的悲傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的修士",
      "text": "哭泣也好，歡笑也好，如果那就是您的道別......想必他都會欣然接受的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭市民",
      "text": "謝謝你......修士小姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "溫和的修士",
      "text": "我陪您去外面的花田走走吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥，那個姐姐說她的父親也“去世”了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "嗯......去世的人，就會來到這裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "活著的人，在這裡與他們道別......然後，帶著對去世之人的思念，繼續自己的生活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "那去世的人呢，他們做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......也許會在天上看著我們吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "因為去了天上，所以再也見不到了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "塞茜莉亞，給你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "這是......媽媽的守護銃？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "我的爸爸媽媽，都是公證所的執行者。小時候我很少能見到他們......是爺爺把我帶大的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "爺爺很喜歡他的銃，每次擦銃的時候，都會和我講起他年輕時的事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "他參加過的戰役，他的戰友，他怎麼遇到奶奶，還有我爸爸小時候的糗事......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "看到爺爺的銃，我就會想起他講的那些故事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "......後來，爺爺去世了。我那時也只比你現在大一點點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "公證所的執行者，帶走了他的守護銃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "就像你母親的守護銃，本應被我帶走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "艾澤爾緩緩蹲下，將費莉亞的銃放在塞茜莉亞手中。\n塞茜莉亞低下頭，看著手中母親的守護銃。\n艾澤爾輕輕握住塞茜莉亞的手。\n溫熱的水滴跌落在守護銃的浮雕花紋上，流到年幼女孩的掌心，堆積成一小片水漬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "艾澤爾哥哥......我怎麼哭了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "我按爺爺教我的，每周給後院的盆栽澆水，後來它們開花了，我很高興，喊爺爺來看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "喊出聲才想起來，爺爺已經不在了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "我再也見不到爺爺，再也沒見過他的銃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "艾澤爾",
      "text": "死亡就是永不再會的離別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塞茜莉亞",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "然而離別本身即是對死亡的克服。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "存者在此，去者在彼，才有“離別”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "“離別”是生者對逝者的惦念，也因此成為逝者存在的證明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "修士",
      "text": "這就是為何我們需要道別。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
